The first real pass stopped before evaluating any joint configuration: the physics context names the logical default as `BASE:<carrier>`, while its stored zero-change configuration record uses the canonical `CFG:…` ID. I found the identity mismatch at the read boundary; the mappings/outcomes are not in disagreement. I’m switching lookup to the unique `delta_from_default == []` record, preserving the logical-default assertion, then restarting from the clean empty output directory.
